    {
      "file": "elemental-sandbox.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 55,
      "zh": "第一章 · 重力",
      "en": "Chapter 1 · Gravity"
    },
    {
      "file": "elemental-sandbox.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 55,
      "zh": "沉降标本",
      "en": "Sedimentation Specimen"
    },
    {
      "file": "elemental-sandbox.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 55,
      "zh": "让沙粒穿过空气并在实验区最底部形成连续沉积。",
      "en": "Let sand grains fall through the air and form a continuous deposit at the very bottom of the lab area."
    },
    {
      "file": "elemental-sandbox.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 55,
      "zh": "底层沉积 90 格",
      "en": "Bottom deposit: 90 cells"
    },
    {
      "file": "elemental-sandbox.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 55,
      "zh": "在上方横向铺沙，让它自行下落；墙体可以塑造漏斗。",
      "en": "Spread sand sideways at the top and let it fall by itself; walls can shape a funnel."
    },
    {
      "file": "elemental-sandbox.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 56,
      "zh": "静水围堰",
      "en": "Still-Water Cofferdam"
    },
    {
      "file": "elemental-sandbox.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 56,
      "zh": "用墙体围出容器，让足够多的水稳定留在实验区下半部。",
      "en": "Build a container with walls and keep enough water stable in the lower half of the lab area."
    },
    {
      "file": "elemental-sandbox.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 56,
      "zh": "下半区蓄水 260 格",
      "en": "Water in lower half: 260 cells"
    },
    {
      "file": "elemental-sandbox.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 56,
      "zh": "先画 U 形墙，再从上方注水。封闭容器比堆满屏幕更省笔画。",
      "en": "Draw a U-shaped wall first, then pour water in from above. A closed container takes fewer strokes than filling the whole screen."
    },
    {
      "file": "elemental-sandbox.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 57,
      "zh": "热压回路",
      "en": "Thermal Pressure Loop"
    },
    {
      "file": "elemental-sandbox.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 57,
      "zh": "让水与火接触，累计生成蒸汽并观察它上浮。",
      "en": "Bring water and fire into contact, accumulate steam and watch it rise."
    },
    {
      "file": "elemental-sandbox.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 57,
      "zh": "生成 70 份蒸汽",
      "en": "Make 70 steam"
    },
    {
      "file": "elemental-sandbox.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 57,
      "zh": "用墙围住水池，在水面持续补火；蒸汽会上升并缓慢凝结。",
      "en": "Surround a pool with walls and keep adding fire at the water surface; steam rises and slowly condenses."
    },
    {
      "file": "elemental-sandbox.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 58,
      "zh": "第二章 · 相变",
      "en": "Chapter 2 · Phase Change"
    },
    {
      "file": "elemental-sandbox.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 58,
      "zh": "晶化窑炉",
      "en": "Crystallization Kiln"
    },
    {
      "file": "elemental-sandbox.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 58,
      "zh": "高温会把沙熔成玻璃，完成一批稳定晶化样本。",
      "en": "High heat melts sand into glass; complete a batch of stable crystallized samples."
    },
    {
      "file": "elemental-sandbox.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 58,
      "zh": "熔制 55 格玻璃",
      "en": "Fuse 55 cells of glass"
    },
    {
      "file": "elemental-sandbox.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 58,
      "zh": "先铺沙，再让火沿沙层传播；玻璃会保持为固体。",
      "en": "Lay sand first, then let fire travel along the sand layer; glass stays solid."
    },
    {
      "file": "elemental-sandbox.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 59,
      "zh": "温室复苏",
      "en": "Greenhouse Revival"
    },
    {
      "file": "elemental-sandbox.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 59,
      "zh": "让水滋养植物，新生组织会在湿润边界扩张。",
      "en": "Let water nourish plants; new tissue expands along damp borders."
    },
    {
      "file": "elemental-sandbox.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 59,
      "zh": "培育 65 格新植物",
      "en": "Grow 65 cells of new plants"
    },
    {
      "file": "elemental-sandbox.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 59,
      "zh": "植物与水相邻时会向附近空气生长，狭长水渠很有效。",
      "en": "Plants grow into nearby air when next to water; a long narrow channel works well."
    },
    {
      "file": "elemental-sandbox.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 60,
      "zh": "可控燃烧",
      "en": "Controlled Burn"
    },
    {
      "file": "elemental-sandbox.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 60,
      "zh": "先让油形成燃烧链，再用水或冰抑制火势。",
      "en": "Let oil form a burning chain first, then suppress the fire with water or ice."
    },
    {
      "file": "elemental-sandbox.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 60,
      "zh": "连燃 55，灭火 18",
      "en": "Chain 55, extinguish 18"
    },
    {
      "file": "elemental-sandbox.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 60,
      "zh": "油在低处聚集；完成连燃后，从上方浇水或铺冰。",
      "en": "Oil gathers in low spots; after the chain burn, pour water or lay ice from above."
    },
    {
      "file": "elemental-sandbox.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 61,
      "zh": "第三章 · 催化",
      "en": "Chapter 3 · Catalysis"
    },
    {
      "file": "elemental-sandbox.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 61,
      "zh": "腐蚀窗口",
      "en": "Corrosion Window"
    },
    {
      "file": "elemental-sandbox.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 61,
      "zh": "用酸处理金属，并保留足够的金属作为反应边界。",
      "en": "Treat metal with acid and keep enough metal as a reaction boundary."
    },
    {
      "file": "elemental-sandbox.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 61,
      "zh": "完成 45 次酸蚀",
      "en": "Complete 45 acid etches"
    },
    {
      "file": "elemental-sandbox.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 61,
      "zh": "把金属画成薄片，再让酸从上方流过，接触面积决定速度。",
      "en": "Draw metal as thin sheets and let acid flow over from above; contact area decides the speed."
    },
    {
      "file": "elemental-sandbox.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 62,
      "zh": "盐析缓冲",
      "en": "Salting-Out Buffer"
    },
    {
      "file": "elemental-sandbox.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 62,
      "zh": "用盐中和酸液，避免残余酸继续扩散。",
      "en": "Neutralize the acid with salt so residual acid does not keep spreading."
    },
    {
      "file": "elemental-sandbox.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 62,
      "zh": "完成 60 次中和",
      "en": "Complete 60 neutralizations"
    },
    {
      "file": "elemental-sandbox.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 62,
      "zh": "先用墙围住酸，再从液面撒盐；盐会下沉并逐步消耗酸。",
      "en": "Wall in the acid first, then sprinkle salt from the surface; salt sinks and gradually consumes the acid."
    },
    {
      "file": "elemental-sandbox.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 63,
      "zh": "综合穹顶",
      "en": "Grand Dome"
    },
    {
      "file": "elemental-sandbox.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 63,
      "zh": "在同一实验中记录至少七类不同反应，建立综合反应档案。",
      "en": "In a single experiment, record at least seven different kinds of reactions to build a complete reaction archive."
    },
    {
      "file": "elemental-sandbox.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 63,
      "zh": "本次发现 7 类反应",
      "en": "Discover 7 reaction types this run"
    },
