      "file": "elemental-sandbox.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 63,
      "zh": "合理分区：水火、沙火、油火、冰火、植物水、酸金属、盐酸、电弧水都可计入。",
      "en": "Zone sensibly: water-fire, sand-fire, oil-fire, ice-fire, plant-water, acid-metal, salt-acid and arc-water all count."
